Doodlebog holds the record for both having the longest gap between changes and the longest gap between release and its first change, as it was released as a summon through So Sorry, but got its first change all the way into Beta 25.0.

In this change, it gained -1/-1, but also gained an effect for it, a Magic effect which increased its ATK or HP by 1 depending on where it is placed on the board.

=== Stats ===
ATK:
* 3 (Pre Beta 25.0)
* 2 (Post Beta 25.0, Current)
HP:
* 3 (Pre Beta 25.0)
* 2 (Post Beta 25.0, Current)
Cost: 2

Abilities:
* N/A (Pre Beta 25.0)
* Magic: If played on the left side, gain +1 HP. If played on the right side, gain +1 ATK. (Post Beta 25.0, Current)
Rarity: White (Common)

